{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Mont-bell新出方形輕量水樽！</p><p>日本戶外品牌 Mont-bell 推出的方形隨行水瓶近日在網上爆紅，以書本般薄型的扁平方形剪裁、極輕重量與高容量著稱。這款水瓶最大賣點在於顛覆傳統圓形水樽的設計，採用扁平長方形剪裁，外形宛如一本精裝小書，能平整貼合地滑入斜挎包、外套大口袋、公事包甚至電腦包的夾層縫隙，背負時不會產生凸起異物感，極致節省行李空間。</p><p>小巧輕便容量大</p><p>材質方面採用不含 BPA 的食品級樹脂與矽膠，兼具輕量化、抗摔耐磨與防滲漏功能。 瓶蓋密封性極佳，即使隨手扔進背包內翻滾，亦無須擔心水珠滲漏弄濕護照或電子產品。產品提供 0.5L、1.0L 及 1.5L 三種容量規格，售價由 2,200 日圓起（約港幣 110 元）</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179231762126993305_18812647056ad498b597cc1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17923176235298480_20311892536ad498b8a8d5b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179231762702462775_5352920606ad498bb533a1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T10:18:50.767797+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":382,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:00:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T10:57:35.844770+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T10:17:34.059557+00:00","content_hash":"1d5ad60ad7d4780ff3abfd9a93c1812ef8858c3518a40d8b208425b60ddeb110","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}